    "updated_at": "2026-06-18T12:24:26Z",
    "body": "`hour12` as a boolean attribute is probably not enough for the stated tri-state need? HTML boolean attributes can represent true/false, but probably not 'default'. Maybe use an enumerated attribute aligned with ECMA-402 hour cycle concepts, or defer it?\n",
