    "created_at": "2026-06-24T16:35:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-24T16:35:09Z",
    "body": "I think it would be nice to support [date time string format](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Date#date_time_string_format) strings for specifying how the time should be rendered:\n- they are already a familiar pattern for formatting date time values as strings on the web \n- the format is less verbose than specifying many attributes\n- it’s easy to tell at a glance what the final rendered date time string will look like",
    "author_association": "NONE",
